  "Title": "Winter English Courses",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Winter English Courses",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass94665D4348C141B88B93883B220CCC01\"><p>\u200bAfter the success of the Summer English Courses last year, ELE_net offered a programme of Winter English Courses. This consisted of the following courses&#58; Academic Discussion Skills, Academic Presentation Skills, English for the Media and Language Accuracy in Writing. The courses ran over a four-week period from mid-November. Attendance on the courses was very good, with over 150 students registering for them.</p><p>ELE_net received very positive feedback from the students taking the courses. Building on this success, ELE_net is planning to over the Summer and Winter programmes again in 2019 and add additional courses, such as Conversational English and Academic Grammar.</p><p>To register online for the Summer 2019 courses, please go to \n      <a href=\"http&#58;//www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx</a>. \n   </p></div>",
